Package: VCFArrow
Title: VCFArrow: a fast and efficient R package for VCF manipulation and transformation
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-06-25
Authors@R: 
    person("Tomas", "Hrbek", , "hrbek@evoamazon.net", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3239-7068"))
Maintainer: Tomas Hrbek <hrbek@evoamazon.net>
Description: This package has six main functionalities: (1) reading in and writing out VCF data files, including precalculation of diverse metrics used in the filtering functions; (2) data filtering functions; (3) merging VCFs; (4) subsetting VCFs; (5) generation of summary statistics and graphs; and (6) data transformation and writing out of other data formats for posterior analyses.
URL: https://legalLab.github.io/VCFArrow/
